{"data":{"degrees":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Technical High School in Software Development","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Logic & Algorithms","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Systems Analysis (UML)","Software Testing"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":null},"html":"<p>Comprehensive 3-module technical program focused on the analysis, design, development, testing, and deployment of computational systems. The curriculum emphasizes multi-platform development and industry-standard practices.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Curriculum:</strong> Mastered <strong>Algorithms &#x26; Programming Logic</strong>, relational database modeling (MER/DER) and SQL implementation, and Object-Oriented Programming (OOP).</li>\n<li><strong>Web &#x26; Mobile Development:</strong> Built responsive web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP/Java, alongside native mobile Android development.</li>\n<li><strong>Engineering &#x26; Quality:</strong> Learned <strong>Systems Analysis</strong> (Requirements, UML Diagramming), Interface Design (UI/UX principles), and Software Testing methodologies.</li>\n<li><strong>Capstone Project (TCC):</strong> Developed and documented a complete software solution for a real-world problem, managing the project lifecycle from conception to deployment.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Ensino Médio Técnico em Desenvolvimento de Sistemas","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Lógica & Algoritmos","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Análise de Sistemas (UML)","Teste de Software"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Programa técnico abrangente de 3 módulos focado na análise, design, desenvolvimento, teste e implantação de sistemas computacionais. O currículo enfatiza o desenvolvimento multiplataforma e práticas padrão da indústria.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Currículo Central:</strong> Domínio de <strong>Lógica de Programação &#x26; Algoritmos</strong>, modelagem de banco de dados relacional (MER/DER), implementação SQL e Programação Orientada a Objetos (POO).</li>\n<li><strong>Desenvolvimento Web &#x26; Mobile:</strong> Construção de aplicações web responsivas usando HTML, CSS, JavaScript e PHP/Java, juntamente com desenvolvimento mobile nativo para Android.</li>\n<li><strong>Engenharia &#x26; Qualidade:</strong> Aprendizado de <strong>Análise de Sistemas</strong> (Requisitos, Diagramação UML), Design de Interface (princípios UI/UX) e metodologias de Teste de Software.</li>\n<li><strong>Projeto de Conclusão (TCC):</strong> Desenvolvimento e documentação de uma solução de software completa para um problema real, gerenciando o ciclo de vida do projeto desde a concepção até a implantação.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Interdisciplinary Bachelor's Degree in Science & Technology","school":"Universidade Federal do ABC","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/1849b/ufabc.jpg 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/3f5de/ufabc.jpg 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/dae43/ufabc.avif 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/d7667/ufabc.avif 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/7ec1a/ufabc.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/5d873/ufabc.webp 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/26a00/ufabc.webp 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/f23f0/ufabc.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"end":"2028","tech":["Multivariable Calculus","Linear Algebra & Geometry","Information Processing (Python)","Quantum & Matter Physics","Epistemology of Science","Probability & Statistics"],"external":"https://www.ufabc.edu.br/","lang":null},"html":"<p>Innovative, broad-spectrum STEM degree that serves as the mandatory foundational cycle for advanced science majors. Renowned for its rigorous quarter-based system and interdisciplinary approach to problem-solving.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Quantitative Rigor:</strong> Intense coursework in <strong>Calculus (Single &#x26; Multivariable)</strong>, Analytical Geometry, and Differential Equations, providing the mathematical modeling skills required for high-level computing.</li>\n<li><strong>Computational Thinking:</strong> Developed algorithmic problem-solving skills through \"Information Processing,\" bridging the gap between mathematical theory and code implementation.</li>\n<li><strong>Natural Sciences:</strong> Integrated study of <strong>Structure of Matter</strong>, Quantum Mechanics concepts, and Thermodynamics, fostering a deep understanding of physical phenomena.</li>\n<li><strong>Critical Analysis:</strong> Unique focus on <strong>Science, Technology, and Society (STS)</strong> and Epistemology, training the ability to analyze the social and ethical impact of technological innovation.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bacharelado Interdisciplinar em Ciência & Tecnologia (BC&T)","school":"Universidade Federal do ABC","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/1849b/ufabc.jpg 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/3f5de/ufabc.jpg 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/dae43/ufabc.avif 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/d7667/ufabc.avif 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/7ec1a/ufabc.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/5d873/ufabc.webp 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/26a00/ufabc.webp 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/f23f0/ufabc.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"end":"2028","tech":["Cálculo de Várias Variáveis","Álgebra Linear & Geometria","Processamento da Informação (Python)","Física Quântica & Matéria","Epistemologia da Ciência","Probabilidade & Estatística"],"external":"https://www.ufabc.edu.br/","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Graduação STEM inovadora e ampla que serve como ciclo fundamental obrigatório para especializações avançadas em ciências. Reconhecido pelo sistema quadrimestral rigoroso e abordagem interdisciplinar para resolução de problemas.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rigor Quantitativo:</strong> Cursos intensos em <strong>Cálculo (Variável Única &#x26; Múltipla)</strong>, Geometria Analítica e Equações Diferenciais, fornecendo as habilidades de modelagem matemática necessárias para computação de alto nível.</li>\n<li><strong>Pensamento Computacional:</strong> Desenvolvimento de habilidades de resolução de problemas algorítmicos através de \"Processamento da Informação\", unindo a teoria matemática à implementação de código.</li>\n<li><strong>Ciências Naturais:</strong> Estudo integrado da <strong>Estrutura da Matéria</strong>, conceitos de Mecânica Quântica e Termodinâmica, promovendo um entendimento profundo dos fenômenos físicos.</li>\n<li><strong>Análise Crítica:</strong> Foco único em <strong>Ciência, Tecnologia e Sociedade (CTS)</strong> e Epistemologia, treinando a habilidade de analisar o impacto social e ético da inovação tecnológica.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bachelor's Degree in Computer Science","school":"Universidade Federal do ABC","date":"2028","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/1849b/ufabc.jpg 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/3f5de/ufabc.jpg 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/dae43/ufabc.avif 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/d7667/ufabc.avif 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/7ec1a/ufabc.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/5d873/ufabc.webp 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/26a00/ufabc.webp 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/f23f0/ufabc.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"end":"2030","tech":["Graph Theory","Formal Languages & Automata","Operating Systems","Distributed Systems","Artificial Intelligence","Computer Networks","Quantum Computing (Optional)"],"external":"https://www.ufabc.edu.br/","lang":null},"html":"<p>Rigorous \"Post-BI\" program following the Bachelor of Science &#x26; Technology (BC&#x26;T), emphasizing the mathematical foundations and advanced engineering of computing systems.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Theoretical Core:</strong> Mastered <strong>Graph Theory</strong>, <strong>Formal Languages</strong>, and <strong>Automata Theory</strong>, providing the tools to solve complex algorithmic problems and understand computability limits.</li>\n<li><strong>Systems Engineering:</strong> Deep dive into low-level computing with <strong>Operating Systems</strong>, Compilers, and Computer Architecture, focusing on concurrency, memory management, and process scheduling.</li>\n<li><strong>Advanced Topics:</strong> Explored cutting-edge fields through elective tracks in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and High-Performance Computing.</li>\n<li><strong>Research Oriented:</strong> Strong academic emphasis on scientific initiation and solving non-trivial computational problems.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bacharelado em Ciência da Computação (BCC)","school":"Universidade Federal do ABC","date":"2028","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg","srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/1849b/ufabc.jpg 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/3f5de/ufabc.jpg 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/2b365/ufabc.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/dae43/ufabc.avif 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/d7667/ufabc.avif 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/7ec1a/ufabc.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/5d873/ufabc.webp 175w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/26a00/ufabc.webp 350w,\n/static/ce9deef16326f10067283bf7ab605872/f23f0/ufabc.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"end":"2030","tech":["Teoria dos Grafos","Linguagens Formais & Autômatos","Sistemas Operacionais","Sistemas Distribuídos","Inteligência Artificial","Redes de Computadores","Computação Quântica (Optativa)"],"external":"https://www.ufabc.edu.br/","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Programa rigoroso de \"Pós-BI\" que segue o Bacharelado em Ciência e Tecnologia (BC&#x26;T), enfatizando as fundações matemáticas e engenharia avançada de sistemas computacionais.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Núcleo Teórico:</strong> Domínio de <strong>Teoria dos Grafos</strong>, <strong>Linguagens Formais</strong> e <strong>Teoria dos Autômatos</strong>, fornecendo as ferramentas para resolver problemas algorítmicos complexos e entender os limites da computabilidade.</li>\n<li><strong>Engenharia de Sistemas:</strong> Aprofundamento em computação de baixo nível com <strong>Sistemas Operacionais</strong>, Compiladores e Arquitetura de Computadores, focando em concorrência, gerenciamento de memória e escalonamento de processos.</li>\n<li><strong>Tópicos Avançados:</strong> Exploração de campos de ponta através de trilhas eletivas em Inteligência Artificial, Aprendizado de Máquina e Computação de Alto Desempenho.</li>\n<li><strong>Orientado à Pesquisa:</strong> Forte ênfase acadêmica na iniciação científica e na resolução de problemas computacionais não triviais.</li>\n</ul>"}}]}}}